OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is a busway and why is one
OL,4,Abeing built through greenbelt?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter years of uncertainty, permission
OL,7,Fhas now been given to build a new
OL,8,Fbusway between Cambourne and Cambridge.
OL,10,FKnown locally as the C2C, it has been
OL,11,Fin the planning for more than a decade
OL,12,Fand has been the subject of a lot of
OL,13,Fopposition.
OL,15,FOpponents said the route over greenbelt
OL,16,Fland and through an orchard was the
OL,17,Fwrong route to choose. Supporters say
OL,18,Fit will provide a direct route to
OL,19,FCambridge for thousands of new homes
OL,20,Fbeing built in the area.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
